        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "BRAND BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nBrand / vertical: eyewear DTC\nAd format: street interview ad\nTarget viewer: a retired hobbyist with disposable income\nCore promise: [one sentence, no superlatives]\nProof point: [the one thing shown, not claimed]\nOffer / CTA: [exact wording]\nRuntime: 20 seconds. Do not invent claims beyond this brief."
        },
        "name": "Brand brief"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_Z6B12N4GNG1CGG0KHSC8T1E1XD",
        "kind": "character-input",
